# Frontend Atomic

Read and obey `harness/constitutions/frontend.md`.

- TypeScript + yarn + React + Next.js App Router + Ant Design.
- Prefer latest stable antd, then align React/Next.
- Before inventing colors/logos, read `harness/supply/visual-identity.md` and files under `harness/supply/assets/`.
- Atomic layers; no upward imports.
- Component tests + Playwright e2e.
- LLM reference: https://ant.design/docs/react/introduce.md
- Repo name must be `ui-<context>`.
